⚡️ Israel approves its first regulated stablecoin

Israel granted approval for the first stablecoin pegged to the shekel. The token, BILS, was developed in collaboration with the Solana network and crypto custodian heavyweights Fireblocks with auditing oversight provided by Big Four consultancy firm EY.

